The next morning the sun shines into the living room.
Bruno and I are having a very relaxed morning.
He is lying on the rug and looking at me.
He wants to play.
I go to Sabine's bag and look for his favourite toy.
It is a small red ball.
I find it and show it to Bruno.
Bruno jumps up immediately.
He wags his tail excitedly.
I throw the ball across the room.
"Fetch it, Bruno!" I say.
He runs off quickly and fetches the ball.
Then he comes back to me.
"Give it to me!" I say, laughing.
He drops the ball.
"Good dog!"
I praise him.
I give him a small treat.
But he is not allowed to eat too many treats.
He must take a little break now.
